<https://decision-cli.dev/ns/cr/CR-STATUS> <https://decision-cli.dev/ns#capabilityBody> "{\n  \"command\": \"dec status\",\n  \"synopsis\": \"Report the active value stream's bootstrap provenance.\",\n  \"flags\": [],\n  \"positionals\": [],\n  \"exit_codes\": [\n    {\"code\": 0, \"meaning\": \"active stream printed\"},\n    {\"code\": 2, \"meaning\": \"no init found\"}\n  ]\n}" <https://decision-cli.dev/ns/graph/catalog> .
