<https://decision-cli.dev/oxi-events/ns/mutation/18db2faf-25e9-437a-a6f5-3c822941853f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://decision-cli.dev/oxi-events/ns#Mutation> <https://decision-cli.dev/oxi-events/ns/meta> .
